## SQ-CMP-01 | Compat loads, mixins apply once
@group A
@commands `grep -E "\[creativecompat\]\|creativecompat.mixins.json" logs/latest.log`; `grep -c "from creativecompat.mixins.json" logs/debug.log`; `python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/cmp_mixin_check.py` (listed vs applied, no count typed in)
@pass Compat core line; no mixin apply error; every common mixin in the jar list applies on the server except those its gate skips (mod absent or out of range; `CompatMixinPlugin`); none applied twice or also from Creative Engineering
@fails Jar missing, a gate id wrong in `CompatMixinPlugin`, or Creative Common still listing a moved mixin (applied twice)
@from batches/r1101/cs2_boot2.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-22
bootexpect \[creativecompat\] loaded \(config/
bootreject creativecompat\.mixins\.json.*(Error|error|failed)
# r1123cx (2026-11-23): the pathfinding mixins (SnowPathMixin, LeafPilePathMixin) apply when the first mob paths, about 1 s after Done; a mob and a wait first
> summon minecraft:zombie 0 100 0
sleep 10
shell python3 $INST/tools/scratch_query/cmp_mixin_check.py
# 2026-11-22: the typed 27 (and the writeup's 32) is gone: the jar lists 86 common mixins, 76 applied on the full pack, 10 skipped by gate (r1122cc); cmp_mixin_check.py compares the lists

